<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><meta name="robots" content="noindex,nofollow"><title>Chinese 4 · Paper C · Optional preparation</title><base href="/api/v1/course-tests/chinese-4/c/file/"><link rel="stylesheet" href="paper.css"></head><body><main><header class="hero"><p class="eyebrow">HSKKit · Chinese 4 Course Review · Original Paper C</p><h1>Optional preparation</h1><p>40 objective questions + 4 writing/speaking tasks · 100-minute section budget.</p><p class="note">Reference materials. Open the workspace for section clocks, local answer saving and recording. Writing and speaking need self-review or your own teacher; no automatic grade.</p><nav class="links"><a href="index.html">Overview</a><a href="student.html">Learner paper</a><a href="student-traditional.html">繁體試卷</a><a href="teacher.html">Answers &amp; scripts</a><a href="listening.html">Listen to Chinese 4 C</a><a href="student.pdf">Learner PDF</a><a href="student-traditional.pdf">繁體 PDF</a><a href="teacher.pdf">Answer PDF</a></nav></header><section class="box"><p>Optional before-practice support. No pinyin is shown in the learner paper. This is an author-selected list, not a complete calibrated word list.</p><p class="cn">口述 <span class="note">oral account</span></p><p class="cn">称呼 <span class="note">name used for something</span></p><p class="cn">路线 <span class="note">route</span></p><p class="cn">代替 <span class="note">stand for/replace</span></p><p class="cn">发布 <span class="note">publish</span></p><p class="cn">示意图 <span class="note">illustrative diagram</span></p><p class="cn">草稿 <span class="note">draft</span></p><p class="cn">核对 <span class="note">check against requirements</span></p><p class="cn">坡道 <span class="note">ramp</span></p><p class="cn">预计 <span class="note">estimated</span></p><p class="cn">暂存架 <span class="note">temporary storage rack</span></p><p class="cn">期限 <span class="note">deadline</span></p><p class="cn">取景 <span class="note">framing a photograph</span></p><p class="cn">冷清 <span class="note">quiet/deserted</span></p><p class="cn">长椅 <span class="note">bench</span></p><p class="cn">断定 <span class="note">conclude with certainty</span></p><p class="cn">盆栽 <span class="note">potted plant</span></p><p class="cn">照护 <span class="note">care</span></p><p class="cn">接替 <span class="note">take over</span></p><p class="cn">扩展 <span class="note">expand</span></p><p class="cn">维修 <span class="note">maintenance</span></p><p class="cn">绕行 <span class="note">take a detour</span></p><p class="cn">过期 <span class="note">outdated</span></p><p class="cn">时间线 <span class="note">timeline</span></p><p class="cn">摆摊 <span class="note">run a small stall</span></p><p class="cn">现行 <span class="note">currently used</span></p><p class="cn">现状 <span class="note">current situation</span></p><p class="cn">化名 <span class="note">pseudonym</span></p><p class="cn">范围 <span class="note">scope</span></p><p class="cn">署名 <span class="note">credit/name attribution</span></p><p class="cn">产出 <span class="note">work output</span></p><p class="cn">受访者 <span class="note">interviewee</span></p><p class="cn">待确认 <span class="note">awaiting confirmation</span></p><p class="cn">展厅 <span class="note">exhibition hall</span></p><p class="cn">停留 <span class="note">stop/stay</span></p><p class="cn">暂存 <span class="note">temporary storage</span></p><p class="cn">通道 <span class="note">passageway</span></p><p class="cn">边界 <span class="note">boundary</span></p><p class="cn">参数 <span class="note">technical setting</span></p><p class="cn">奖项 <span class="note">award</span></p><p class="cn">失落 <span class="note">disappointment</span></p><p class="cn">光照 <span class="note">light exposure</span></p><p class="cn">后续 <span class="note">follow-up</span></p><p class="cn">意向 <span class="note">expression of interest</span></p><p class="cn">缺口 <span class="note">unfilled gap</span></p><p class="cn">离线 <span class="note">offline</span></p><p class="cn">围栏 <span class="note">barrier</span></p><p class="cn">匿名 <span class="note">anonymous</span></p><p class="cn">消除 <span class="note">erase/remove</span></p></section></main></body></html>